sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant W as Web Function (Express)
    participant A as AgentCore Runtime
    participant M as Claude Sonnet 5.5

    B->>W: POST /chat { message, sessionId }
    Note over W: validate message<br/>build {prompt} payload
    W->>A: InvokeAgentRuntimeCommand(arn, sessionId, payload)
    A->>M: stream prompt
    loop token by token
        M-->>A: text delta
        A-->>W: text/event-stream chunk
        W-->>B: SSE event: token
    end
    M-->>A: end_turn
    A-->>W: stream closes
    W-->>B: SSE event: done
    Note over B: UI appends tokens live
